        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The two girls working here are absolute delights. They are so sweet, especially Ellie (hopefully I’m writing it right). They’re easy to talk to and are incredibly welcoming.\nLove the vibes of the place. Great place to hangout with friends :)",
